CREATED:20260430T155943Z
DESCRIPTION:Am I my brother's keeper? The oldest question posed by one hum
 an concerning his responsibility to another\, one then posed and re-posed
  by artists ever since. What do owe each other\; our families\; our commu
 nities\; our friends\; and our enemies\, real and imagined? We'll ponder 
 it all through music born out of compassion and the search for justice. F
 eaturing an all-baroque performance on period instruments\, with works of
  Bach\; Biber\; and Marais. \n\nPROGRAM\nBach\, Sinfonia: Nach dir\, Herr
 \, verlanget mich\; Biber\, Mystery Sonatas\, 4\, 5\, 10\, & 11\; Marais\
