CREATED:20260513T175620Z
DESCRIPTION:This summer\, the Congregation at Duke Chapel invites you to j
 oin a 10-week adult Bible study\, Being Church\, led by Pastor Ryan Wilso
 n. This series will explore what it means to be the church in today's wor
 ld through scripture\, conversation\, and reflection. Grounded primarily 
 in the book of Acts and the Epistles\, we will examine how Christian comm
 unity is shaped by worship\, prayer\, fellowship\, justice\, reconciliati
 on\, service\, and hope. Together we will wrestle honestly with both the 
 beauty and brokenness of the church while listening for how the Holy Spir
 it is calling us to live as the body of Christ today. All are welcome.
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20260513T180734Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260614T094500
LAST-MODIFIED:20260513T180734Z
